{
 "component": "LineChart",
 "version": 1,
 "summary": "A value-over-time chart that fills its width: a smooth line through a float array or along a function of x, with an optional area fill, baseline, \"now\" marker and highlighted points, and its axis labels as text components (a row under the chart, a column beside it).",
 "params": {
  "values": {
   "type": "float",
   "doc": "Array mode: a float array, \"@name\" of resources.floatArrays (export it to let the host replace it), 2 or more values spread evenly over x_min..x_max; the curve is a monotone spline through every value. Give values or fn"
  },
  "fn": {
   "type": "float",
   "doc": "Function mode: y as an expression of u, the x value (u is pathExpression's sample variable; write u, not x), e.g. \"@mean + @amp * cos((u - @high) * 0.004363)\"; drawn over x_min..x_max. At most 20 entries (each number, variable, operator and function is one): the area fill adds 12 and Android refuses a path expression over 32. Needs y_min and y_max"
  },
  "x_min": {
   "type": "float",
   "default": 0,
   "doc": "x at the left edge (e.g. 0 minutes)"
  },
  "x_max": {
   "type": "float",
   "default": 1,
   "doc": "x at the right edge (e.g. 1440 minutes for a day)"
  },
  "y_min": {
   "type": "float",
   "doc": "Value at the bottom of the plot; default: the array's minimum (array mode), 0 (function mode)"
  },
  "y_max": {
   "type": "float",
   "doc": "Value at the top of the plot; default: the array's maximum (array mode), 1 (function mode)"
  },
  "baseline": {
   "type": "float",
   "doc": "Draw a horizontal line at this value (0 °C, mean sea level, the horizon); the area then fills down (or up) to it instead of the bottom"
  },
  "now": {
   "type": "float",
   "doc": "x of the 'now' marker (a vertical line and a dot on the curve). For a chart over today, \"timeInMin()\": the device's current minute of the day, so the marker moves by itself. Never a variable frozen at a value. An x value (e.g. \"timeInMin()\" or a variable) to mark with a vertical line and a dot on the curve; clamped to x_min..x_max"
  },
  "marks": {
   "type": "list",
   "doc": "x values to mark with a dot on the curve (numbers or \"@variables\", e.g. the times of high and low tide); fixed in number when the document is built"
  },
  "extremes": {
   "type": "bool",
   "default": false,
   "static": true,
   "doc": "Array mode: a dot on the highest and the lowest value"
  },
  "area": {
   "type": "bool",
   "default": true,
   "static": true,
   "doc": "Fill under the line with a 16% wash of its colour (down to the baseline when given; none in mono)"
  },
  "color": {
   "type": "color",
   "default": "@colors.primary",
   "doc": "Line, area and dot colour (onSurface in mono)"
  },
  "thickness": {
   "type": "float",
   "default": 2.5,
   "static": true,
   "doc": "Line width in dp (2 in mono)"
  },
  "xLabels": {
   "type": "list",
   "doc": "Texts under the plot, evenly spaced from x_min (first) to x_max (last), each centred under its x: [\"00\", \"06\", \"12\", \"18\", \"24\"]. The plot is inset by half a label cell on each side to line up with them"
  },
  "yLabels": {
   "type": "list",
   "doc": "Texts beside the plot, evenly spaced from y_max (first, top) to y_min (last, bottom), with a faint grid line at each: set y_min and y_max to the values they name"
  },
  "yLabelWidth": {
   "type": "float",
   "default": 32,
   "static": true,
   "doc": "Width in dp of the yLabels column (right-aligned text)"
  },
  "height": {
   "type": "float",
   "default": 120,
   "static": true,
   "doc": "Plot height in dp, labels not included (ignored with fill)"
  },
  "fill": {
   "type": "bool",
   "default": false,
   "static": true,
   "doc": "Take the height the caller gives it (fillMaxSize, the plot takes what the labels leave) instead of `height`; give it a parent with a size or a weight"
  },
  "samples": {
   "type": "float",
   "default": 64,
   "static": true,
   "doc": "Function mode: points the curve is sampled at (array mode samples 6 per value step)"
  },
  "label": {
   "type": "string",
   "default": "Line chart",
   "doc": "Accessibility label, e.g. \"Water level today, high tide at 3:12\""
  }
 },
 "locals": {
  "span": "@x_max - @x_min",
  "n": {
   "$if": "fn",
   "then": 0,
   "else": "arrayLength(@values)"
  },
  "cnt": {
   "$if": "fn",
   "then": "@samples",
   "else": "@n * 6 - 5"
  },
  "s": "@span / (@cnt - 1)",
  "mid": "(@x_min + @x_max) / 2",
  "half": "@span / 2 + @s / 2",
  "inside": "@span * 0.5001",
  "lo": {
   "$if": "y_min",
   "then": "@y_min",
   "else": {
    "$if": "y_min != 'undefined'",
    "then": "@y_min",
    "else": {
     "$if": "fn",
     "then": 0,
     "else": "arrayMin(@values)"
    }
   }
  },
  "hi": {
   "$if": "y_max",
   "then": "@y_max",
   "else": {
    "$if": "y_max != 'undefined'",
    "then": "@y_max",
    "else": {
     "$if": "fn",
     "then": 1,
     "else": "arrayMax(@values)"
    }
   }
  },
  "nxl": {
   "$if": "xLabels",
   "then": {
    "$count": "xLabels"
   },
   "else": 1
  },
  "xin": {
   "$if": "xLabels",
   "then": "0.5 / @nxl",
   "else": 0
  },
  "nyl": {
   "$if": "yLabels",
   "then": {
    "$count": "yLabels"
   },
   "else": 2
  },
  "nx": {
   "$if": "now",
   "then": "clamp(@x_min, @x_max, @now)",
   "else": {
    "$if": "now != 'undefined'",
    "then": "clamp(@x_min, @x_max, @now)",
    "else": 0
   }
  }
 },
 "capabilities": [
  "draw.plot",
  "data.array",
  "data.expression",
  "layout.weight"
 ],
 "call": {
  "LineChart": {
   "values": "@temps",
   "xLabels": [
    "00",
    "06",
    "12",
    "18",
    "24"
   ]
  }
 },
 "pitfalls": [
  "A chart of today's values: now is \"timeInMin()\" (with x_min 0, x_max 1440), not a host variable set once; and whatever depends on now in the text around the chart (rising or falling, the next event, the current value) is computed from timeInMin() and the data too (see TIM examples), never typed in.",
  "Which chart: LineChart for a value over time or over a range of x (a day of temperatures, a tide, a price, the sun's altitude) at card or screen width, with axis labels, a now marker or marked points; Sparkline for a word-sized trend beside a label (no axes, no labels); BarChart for separate quantities per category or period (steps per day, visits per week)",
  "Don't hand-draw the chart on a canvas with literal coordinates and drawText labels: this component fills its width, derives every coordinate from componentWidth()/componentHeight() (named canvas variables), and puts its labels in text components, so it relayouts on resize and screen readers reach the labels",
  "Two modes. values is the name of a float array (\"@temps\" in resources.floatArrays), not a JSON list: the curve is arraySpline through every value, spread evenly over x_min..x_max, so a host that sets the exported array redraws it, any length. fn is y as an expression of u, the x value (pathExpression's sample variable: write u, never x or a name of your own); it is spliced into the path's expressions, so it may read document variables and the clock (\"@mean + @amp * cos((u - @high) * 0.0084315)\"). Give one or the other",
  "fn must stay within 20 expression entries (each number, variable, operator and function is one): the area path wraps it in 12 more and Android refuses a path expression over 32 entries with \"Path too long\" — json2rc and the Java parser write it anyway, so only a device shows the failure. Move constants into variables (\"@k\" is one entry; \"2 * 3.14159 / 745.2\" is five) and drop the area if needed",
  "Function mode has no data to scale from: give y_min and y_max (default 0..1). Array mode scales to the array's own min..max unless you give them; a flat series sits on the top edge, and two charts only compare when they share y_min/y_max. Pass the same y_min/y_max the yLabels name: the labels are evenly spaced from y_max down to y_min and only the component's arithmetic, not the text, places the curve",
  "xLabels are evenly spaced from x_min to x_max, each centred in an equal cell under its x, so the plot is inset by half a cell on each side (a 5-label axis on a 300 dp plot loses 30 dp per side); pick labels that divide the range evenly (0, 6, 12, 18, 24 h over 0..1440 min). A label at a data position (\"High 05:12, 2.8 m\") belongs in the caller's layout, a row of text above or below the chart, not on the canvas",
  "now and marks put a dot on the curve itself: each is a two-point path at that x through the same function (a zero-length stroke with a round cap), so the dot follows the curve in either mode with nothing computed twice; now also draws a vertical line and is clamped to x_min..x_max; a mark outside x_min..x_max is not drawn (its dot is moved off the canvas). marks is a list fixed in length when the document is built, but each item may be an expression (\"@high + 372.6\"). A literal 0 for now, baseline, y_min or y_max counts as given",
  "baseline draws a line at that value (0 °C, mean sea level, the horizon) and the area then fills between the curve and it, above and below; without it the area fills to the bottom of the plot. extremes (array mode) dots every value equal to the array's max or min",
  "Mono drops the area wash (no alpha fills on AOD or e-ink) and draws the line in onSurface at 2 dp; the grid, baseline and now line stay the one grey",
  "The body declares named canvas variables and paths, so every call is expanded (about 1.1 KB for a function chart, 1.6 KB with both label rows), never a pattern: fine for the one or two charts a screen shows"
 ],
 "body": {
  "column": {
   "modifiers": [
    {
     "$if": "fill",
     "then": "fillMaxSize",
     "else": "fillMaxWidth"
    }
   ],
   "children": [
    {
     "row": {
      "modifiers": [
       "fillMaxWidth",
       {
        "$if": "fill",
        "then": {
         "verticalWeight": 1
        },
        "else": {
         "height": "@height"
        }
       }
      ],
      "children": [
       {
        "$if": "yLabels",
        "then": {
         "column": {
          "verticalAlignment": "spaceBetween",
          "horizontalAlignment": "end",
          "modifiers": [
           {
            "width": "@yLabelWidth"
           },
           "fillMaxHeight",
           {
            "padding": {
             "end": 6
            }
           }
          ],
          "children": [
           {
            "$each": "yLabels",
            "as": "t",
            "do": {
             "text": {
              "value": "@t",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "color": "@colors.muted",
              "maxLines": 1
             }
            }
           }
          ]
         }
        }
       },
       {
        "canvas": {
         "modifiers": [
          {
           "weight": 1
          },
          "fillMaxHeight",
          {
           "semantics": {
            "contentDescription": "@label"
           }
          }
         ],
         "commands": [
          {
           "variable": {
            "name": "x0",
            "value": {
             "$if": "xLabels",
             "then": "componentWidth() * @xin",
             "else": 6
            }
           }
          },
          {
           "variable": {
            "name": "kx",
            "value": "(componentWidth() - 2 * @x0) / @span"
           }
          },
          {
           "variable": {
            "name": "cx",
            "value": {
             "$if": "x_min",
             "then": "@x0 - @x_min * @kx",
             "else": "@x0"
            }
           }
          },
          {
           "variable": {
            "name": "ky",
            "value": {
             "$if": "fn",
             "then": "(componentHeight() - 14) / (@hi - @lo)",
             "else": "(componentHeight() - 14) / max(@hi - @lo, 0.001)"
            }
           }
          },
          {
           "variable": {
            "name": "cy",
            "value": "7 + @hi * @ky"
           }
          },
          {
           "variable": {
            "name": "by",
            "value": {
             "$if": "baseline",
             "then": "@cy - @baseline * @ky",
             "else": {
              "$if": "baseline != 'undefined'",
              "then": "@cy - @baseline * @ky",
              "else": "componentHeight() - 7"
             }
            }
           }
          },
          {
           "pathExpression": {
            "id": "line",
            "expressionX": "@cx + u * @kx",
            "expressionY": {
             "$if": "fn",
             "then": "@cy - @fn * @ky",
             "else": {
              "$if": "x_min",
              "then": "@cy - arraySpline(@values, (u - @x_min) / @span) * @ky",
              "else": "@cy - arraySpline(@values, u / @span) * @ky"
             }
            },
            "start": "@x_min",
            "end": "@x_max",
            "count": "@cnt",
            "flags": 4
           }
          },
          {
           "$if": "yLabels",
           "then": [
            {
             "paint": {
              "ops": [
               {
                "color": "@colors.track"
               },
               {
                "style": "stroke"
               },
               {
                "strokeWidth": 1
               }
              ]
             }
            },
            {
             "loop": {
              "index": "i",
              "from": 0,
              "until": "@nyl",
              "commands": [
               {
                "drawLine": {
                 "x1": 0,
                 "y1": "7 + i * (componentHeight() - 14) / (@nyl - 1)",
                 "x2": "componentWidth()",
                 "y2": "7 + i * (componentHeight() - 14) / (@nyl - 1)"
                }
               }
              ]
             }
            }
           ]
          },
          {
           "$if": "area",
           "then": {
            "$if": "!theme.mono",
            "then": [
             {
              "$if": "!fn",
              "then": [
               {
                "variable": {
                 "name": "st",
                 "value": "@s"
                }
               },
               {
                "variable": {
                 "name": "hw",
                 "value": "@span / 2 + @st / 2"
                }
               }
              ]
             },
             {
              "pathExpression": {
               "id": "under",
               "expressionX": "@cx + clamp(@x_min, @x_max, u) * @kx",
               "expressionY": {
                "$if": "fn",
                "then": "ifElse(@cy - @fn * @ky, @by, step(abs(u - @mid), @half))",
                "else": {
                 "$if": "x_min",
                 "then": "ifElse(@cy - arraySpline(@values, (u - @x_min) / @span) * @ky, @by, step(abs(u - @mid), @hw))",
                 "else": "ifElse(@cy - arraySpline(@values, u / @span) * @ky, @by, step(abs(u - @mid), @hw))"
                }
               },
               "start": {
                "$if": "fn",
                "then": "@x_min - @s",
                "else": "@x_min - @st"
               },
               "end": {
                "$if": "fn",
                "then": "@x_max + @s",
                "else": "@x_max + @st"
               },
               "count": "@cnt + 2",
               "flags": 4
              }
             },
             {
              "paint": {
               "ops": [
                {
                 "color": "@color"
                },
                {
                 "style": "fill"
                },
                {
                 "alpha": 0.16
                }
               ]
              }
             },
             {
              "drawPath": {
               "path": "under"
              }
             }
            ]
           }
          },
          {
           "$if": "baseline",
           "then": [
            {
             "paint": {
              "ops": [
               {
                "color": "@colors.outline"
               },
               {
                "style": "stroke"
               },
               {
                "strokeWidth": 1
               },
               {
                "alpha": 1
               }
              ]
             }
            },
            {
             "drawLine": {
              "x1": 0,
              "y1": "@by",
              "x2": "componentWidth()",
              "y2": "@by"
             }
            }
           ],
           "else": {
            "$if": "baseline != 'undefined'",
            "then": [
             {
              "paint": {
               "ops": [
                {
                 "color": "@colors.outline"
                },
                {
                 "style": "stroke"
                },
                {
                 "strokeWidth": 1
                },
                {
                 "alpha": 1
                }
               ]
              }
             },
             {
              "drawLine": {
               "x1": 0,
               "y1": "@by",
               "x2": "componentWidth()",
               "y2": "@by"
              }
             }
            ]
           }
          },
          {
           "$if": "now",
           "then": [
            {
             "paint": {
              "ops": [
               {
                "color": "@colors.muted"
               },
               {
                "style": "stroke"
               },
               {
                "strokeWidth": 1
               },
               {
                "alpha": 1
               }
              ]
             }
            },
            {
             "drawLine": {
              "x1": "@cx + @nx * @kx",
              "y1": 0,
              "x2": "@cx + @nx * @kx",
              "y2": "componentHeight()"
             }
            }
           ],
           "else": {
            "$if": "now != 'undefined'",
            "then": [
             {
              "paint": {
               "ops": [
                {
                 "color": "@colors.muted"
                },
                {
                 "style": "stroke"
                },
                {
                 "strokeWidth": 1
                },
                {
                 "alpha": 1
                }
               ]
              }
             },
             {
              "drawLine": {
               "x1": "@cx + @nx * @kx",
               "y1": 0,
               "x2": "@cx + @nx * @kx",
               "y2": "componentHeight()"
              }
             }
            ]
           }
          },
          {
           "paint": {
            "ops": [
             {
              "color": {
               "$if": "theme.mono",
               "then": "@colors.onSurface",
               "else": "@color"
              }
             },
             {
              "style": "stroke"
             },
             {
              "strokeWidth": {
               "$if": "theme.mono",
               "then": "@theme.stroke",
               "else": "@thickness"
              }
             },
             {
              "strokeCap": "round"
             },
             {
              "strokeJoin": "round"
             },
             {
              "alpha": 1
             }
            ]
           }
          },
          {
           "drawPath": {
            "path": "line"
           }
          },
          {
           "$if": "extremes",
           "then": [
            {
             "paint": {
              "ops": [
               {
                "style": "fill"
               }
              ]
             }
            },
            {
             "loop": {
              "index": "i",
              "from": 0,
              "until": "@n",
              "commands": [
               {
                "drawCircle": {
                 "cx": {
                  "$if": "x_min",
                  "then": "@cx + (@x_min + i * @span / (@n - 1)) * @kx",
                  "else": "@cx + i * @span / (@n - 1) * @kx"
                 },
                 "cy": "@cy - arrayGet(@values, i) * @ky",
                 "radius": "4 * (step(arrayGet(@values, i), arrayMax(@values) - 0.0001) + step(arrayMin(@values) + 0.0001, arrayGet(@values, i)))"
                }
               }
              ]
             }
            },
            {
             "paint": {
              "ops": [
               {
                "style": "stroke"
               }
              ]
             }
            }
           ]
          },
          {
           "$if": "marks",
           "then": [
            {
             "$each": "marks",
             "as": "m",
             "index": "k",
             "do": [
              {
               "pathExpression": {
                "id": "mark@k",
                "expressionX": "@cx + u * @kx + 99999 * step(abs(u - @mid), @inside)",
                "expressionY": {
                 "$if": "fn",
                 "then": "@cy - @fn * @ky",
                 "else": {
                  "$if": "x_min",
                  "then": "@cy - arraySpline(@values, (u - @x_min) / @span) * @ky",
                  "else": "@cy - arraySpline(@values, u / @span) * @ky"
                 }
                },
                "start": "@m",
                "end": "@m",
                "count": 2,
                "flags": 4
               }
              },
              {
               "paint": {
                "ops": [
                 {
                  "strokeWidth": 8
                 }
                ]
               }
              },
              {
               "drawPath": {
                "path": "mark@k"
               }
              }
             ]
            }
           ]
          },
          {
           "$if": "now",
           "then": [
            {
             "pathExpression": {
              "id": "nowdot",
              "expressionX": "@cx + u * @kx",
              "expressionY": {
               "$if": "fn",
               "then": "@cy - @fn * @ky",
               "else": {
                "$if": "x_min",
                "then": "@cy - arraySpline(@values, (u - @x_min) / @span) * @ky",
                "else": "@cy - arraySpline(@values, u / @span) * @ky"
               }
              },
              "start": "@nx",
              "end": "@nx",
              "count": 2,
              "flags": 4
             }
            },
            {
             "paint": {
              "ops": [
               {
                "strokeWidth": 11
               }
              ]
             }
            },
            {
             "drawPath": {
              "path": "nowdot"
             }
            }
           ],
           "else": {
            "$if": "now != 'undefined'",
            "then": [
             {
              "pathExpression": {
               "id": "nowdot",
               "expressionX": "@cx + u * @kx",
               "expressionY": {
                "$if": "fn",
                "then": "@cy - @fn * @ky",
                "else": {
                 "$if": "x_min",
                 "then": "@cy - arraySpline(@values, (u - @x_min) / @span) * @ky",
                 "else": "@cy - arraySpline(@values, u / @span) * @ky"
                }
               },
               "start": "@nx",
               "end": "@nx",
               "count": 2,
               "flags": 4
              }
             },
             {
              "paint": {
               "ops": [
                {
                 "strokeWidth": 11
                }
               ]
              }
             },
             {
              "drawPath": {
               "path": "nowdot"
              }
             }
            ]
           }
          }
         ]
        }
       }
      ]
     }
    },
    {
     "$if": "xLabels",
     "then": {
      "row": {
       "modifiers": [
        "fillMaxWidth",
        {
         "padding": {
          "start": {
           "$if": "yLabels",
           "then": "@yLabelWidth",
           "else": 0
          },
          "top": 4
         }
        }
       ],
       "children": [
        {
         "$each": "xLabels",
         "as": "t",
         "do": {
          "text": {
           "value": "@t",
           "fontSize": 11,
           "color": "@colors.muted",
           "maxLines": 1,
           "textAlign": "center",
           "modifiers": [
            {
             "weight": 1
            }
           ]
          }
         }
        }
       ]
      }
     }
    }
   ]
  }
 }
}
